# Build artifacts: search indices regenerated per build
**/public/search-index-*.json

# Blog files merged during site build
apps/site/public/*/blog/
apps/site/public/blog/
apps/site/public/404.html
apps/site/public/404/
**/.turbo/cache/
**/.turbo/turbo-build.log

# Build artifacts: sitemaps, llms, search indexes (regenerated per build)
# Note: do NOT ignore the whole public/ dir, or icons can't be tracked.
# Ignore specific generated files instead.
**/public/sitemap*.xml
**/public/llms*.txt
**/public/llms-*.txt
/robots.txt
/sitemap.xml
/sitemap-images.xml
/sitemap-*.xml

# Cloudflare Worker wrangler.toml with local database_id (not committed)
apps/admin/workers/analytics-cron/wrangler.toml
